The note frequency, amplitude and pan are follow the sine wave frequency, amplitude and phase offset.
Colors are pulled from the (saturated) palette to get the neon glow look.

I was thinking of sine waves, cathode ray tubes, vibrating guitar strings, and windchimes when I made this.

